OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric witch's mark discovered
OL,4,Aat stately home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic witch's mark has been
OL,7,Fdiscovered on a 16th Century wooden
OL,8,Fdoor at a stately home in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FThe intricate circular design was found
OL,11,Fby an "eagle-eyed" visitor on a quiet,
OL,12,Fdimly lit corridor at Hardwick Hall,
OL,13,Fnear Chesterfield.
OL,15,FThe National Trust, which owns the
OL,16,Fsite, said the faint engraving, was a
OL,17,Fritual protection symbol, known as an
OL,18,Fapotropaic marking.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
