OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric witch's mark discovered
OL,4,Aat stately home
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Waring, curator at Hardwick Hall,
OL,7,Fsaid: "This new discovery provides a
OL,8,Ftopical and timely reminder that Bess
OL,9,Fof Hardwick's house continues to
OL,10,Fsurprise."
